Registered acquisition describes a four-storey shophouse numbered 162/143. The rectangular plot has approximately four metres of northern frontage and 18 metres depth in the detailed description and plan. However, the summary fields state six metres frontage and nine metres depth. Verify this discrepancy against title, plan and actual measurements; land area is retained as the source''s 18.3 sq.wah.

SAM reports access via remaining parent title 11996, formerly under subdivision approval before the sale plot 12588 was split off, with access rights retained from the original plot. If a juristic entity is established, the property must pay common-area charges as subdivision land. Verify access evidence, current juristic-entity status, charges and arrears before offering. SAM does not state an amount. Concrete carriageway is approximately six metres wide within a nine-metre right of way.

SAM reports orange zoning and residential, commercial and tourism surroundings, near Jungceylon, Patong Beach, Ban Kham fresh market and Patong Hospital. Location does not confirm hotel or daily-rental permissions; no income or yield is inferred.

From Patong Hospital toward Laem Phromthep along Phang Mueang Sai Kor Road, pass Ban Kham market and Jungceylon, turn left into Su Charoen Patong for 120 metres, then right for 20 metres; the property is on the left. Source landmarks include 7-Eleven and FamilyMart at the entrance; use coordinates as stores may change.

Building/interior photographs display 10 December 2024. Nineteen images include rooms, corridor, kitchen, bathrooms, balconies, access, plot plans and map. Inspect current floors, walls, ceilings, leakage, electrical and plumbing systems.

SAM showed direct purchase and this price on 11 September 2026. Contact 02-686-1888, sales@sam.or.th or LINE @samline, quoting 8Z6770, to confirm availability, price, viewing, dimensions, access rights, common charges and terms.

